+/- swapped on those lines, so this should be:

  12.1) zbasai
  zba + sai
  (1000 * 6) - (500 * 0) + (100 * 0) - (10 * 15) - 3
  = 5847

  12.2) nunynau
  nun + y + nau

  (1000 * 7) - (500 * 0) + (100 * 1) - (10 * 13) - 3
  = 6967

  12.3) sairzbata'u
  sai + r + zba + ta'u

